### GET /collectivities/{id} — CAS NOMINAL (SUCCÈS 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{validCollectivityId}}
x-api-key: agri-secure-key
Accept: application/json

### GET /collectivities/{id} — CAS NOMINAL COLLECTIVITÉ 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{validCollectivityId2}}
Accept: application/json

### GET /collectivities/{id} — CAS NOMINAL COLLECTIVITÉ 3
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{validCollectivityId3}}
Accept: application/json

### GET /collectivities/{id} — ERREUR 404 (COLLECTIVITÉ INEXISTANTE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{invalidCollectivityId}}
Accept: application/json


