### GET /collectivities/{id}/transactions — CAS NOMINAL (SUCCÈS 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{validCollectivityId}}/transactions?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Accept: application/json

### GET /collectivities/{id}/transactions — CAS NOMINAL col-2 avec période courte
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{validCollectivityId2}}/transactions?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-01-31
Accept: application/json

### GET /collectivities/{id}/transactions — CAS NOMINAL col-3 (liste vide attendue)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{validCollectivityId3}}/transactions?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Accept: application/json

### GET /collectivities/{id}/transactions — ERREUR 400 (PARAMÈTRE from MANQUANT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{validCollectivityId}}/transactions?to=2026-12-31
Accept: application/json

### GET /collectivities/{id}/transactions — ERREUR 400 (PARAMÈTRE to MANQUANT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{validCollectivityId}}/transactions?from=2026-01-01
Accept: application/json

### GET /collectivities/{id}/transactions — ERREUR 400 (to AVANT from)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{validCollectivityId}}/transactions?from=2026-12-31&to=2026-01-01
Accept: application/json

### GET /collectivities/{id}/transactions — ERREUR 404 (COLLECTIVITÉ INEXISTANTE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{invalidCollectivityId}}/transactions?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Accept: application/json


### GET /collectivities/{id}/financialAccounts — CAS NOMINAL col-1 (solde actuel)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{validCollectivityId}}/financialAccounts
Accept: application/json

### GET /collectivities/{id}/financialAccounts — CAS NOMINAL col-1 avec paramètre at
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{validCollectivityId}}/financialAccounts?at=2026-01-01
Accept: application/json

### GET /collectivities/{id}/financialAccounts — CAS NOMINAL col-2 (2 comptes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{validCollectivityId2}}/financialAccounts
Accept: application/json

### GET /collectivities/{id}/financialAccounts — CAS NOMINAL col-3 (1 compte caisse)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{validCollectivityId3}}/financialAccounts
Accept: application/json

### GET /collectivities/{id}/financialAccounts — ERREUR 400 (at DANS LE FUTUR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{validCollectivityId}}/financialAccounts?at=2099-01-01
Accept: application/json

### GET /collectivities/{id}/financialAccounts — ERREUR 404 (COLLECTIVITÉ INEXISTANTE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/collectivities/{{invalidCollectivityId}}/financialAccounts
Accept: application/json


